        "slc_a95f240c88b901489d11871445fb47a59310180158806fe65794a8d147902af2"
      ],
      "text": "Users can configure a custom 'Build Ready Text' pattern via Advanced Settings under Specify Repro Steps, used by the verifier to detect when a build step completes."
    },
